        "value": "未編制兵隊　三小隊　一隊六十人"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "未編制兵隊　三小隊　一隊六十人／みへんせいへいたい　さんしょうたい　いったいろくじゅうにん"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Unincorporated troops: three platoons, sixty men to the platoon, that is 180 men. The gloss 一隊六十人 is set in smaller type after 三小隊. This column stands to the RIGHT of the ○村松藩 marker, so it closes Murakami Domain's military return, which begins on the facing leaf (lower_p196_right) with 兵隊　二小隊　一隊六十人, 役員　三十二人 and 喇叭手　八人."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "村上未編制兵隊"
